
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`DATA_NAME: number = 2`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer DATA_NAME = 2;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant DATA_NAME has the value 2</p>
  <p>Used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRequestAgentData" target="_blank">llRequestAgentData</a> to return a string containing the avatars <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Avatar/Name" target="_blank">legacy name</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>AgentData</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <ul>
    <li>For legacy accounts (those with a first and last name). The format is &quot;FirstName LastName&quot;.</li>
    <li>For modern accounts (those with only a first name). The format is &quot;FirstName Resident&quot;.</li>
  </ul>
